ry is published and that a targeted variant belongs to the same project. Keep drafts out of public delivery.\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Try this in the demonstration workspace: inspect the linked records, compare a saved version, and follow the related guide. All audience and performance examples are synthetic.\"}]}","author":"Alex Morgan","locale":"en","environment_id":"2fd256c9-422c-56d7-a23b-b5280b6b222f","cover_url":"https://dyjiyzcsdaeuxtueslqr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/content/assets/ebcc7910-1a0e-4e91-8c3b-752f3c4292d3/78cf2853-c1ac-5d8a-a421-7c0fe8f3bcd8/cover.png","published_at":"2026-08-31T10:00:00.000Z","created_at":"2026-08-20T10:00:00.000Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T10:00:00.000Z","data":{"summary":"Use production, staging, and sandbox to separate live content from experiments.","reading_minutes":3,"featured":false,"review_date":"2026-10-17","related_guide":"bc35f4b0-488c-5044-a6e8-e8d58e62fcef"},"metadata":{"topics":["Delivery"],"tags":["Delivery"],"visibility":"public","campaign":"Autumn product journal","seoTitle":"Publish with confidence across environments","seoDescription":"Use production, staging, and sandbox to separate live content from experiments.","demoSeed":"geiger-content-demonstrator-v1","synthetic":true},"project_id":"ebcc7910-1a0e-4e91-8c3b-752f3c4292d3","created_by":"39149c4b-526f-445b-8a8c-ea3898e9c50c"},"metadata":{"locale":"en","note":"Initial editorial snapshot","demoSeed":"geiger-content-demonstrator-v1","synthetic":true},"created_at":"2026-09-09T10:00:00.000Z","project_id":"ebcc7910-1a0e-4e91-8c3b-752f3c4292d3","created_by":"39149c4b-526f-445b-8a8c-ea3898e9c50c","updated_at":"2026-09-09T10:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"8db69849-19a1-59d7-a494-d3ef37a4f6d7","entry_id":"70d212f7-ed39-5dbf-ae06-7e61586f8f9a","version":2,"published_at":"2026-09-10T10:00:00.000Z","payload":{"id":"70d212f7-ed39-5dbf-ae06-7e61586f8f9a","title":"Publish with confidence across environments","type":"Doc","slug":"demo-publish-with-confidence-acro